      "alignmentMethod": "Torchaudio MMS_FA CTC forced alignment over one continuous checked-in narration",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "01-cold-open",
          "text": "Traditional 3D scans can look complete while missing the instant an accessible route breaks. One lift closes, and the expected journey disappears.",
          "wordCount": 22,
          "alignedWordCount": 22,
          "speechStartSeconds": 0.34,
          "speechEndSeconds": 9.062,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9369,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.6483,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9987
        },
        {
          "id": "02-sceneindex",
          "text": "SceneIndex adds persistent meaning beneath the Gaussian splat: rooms, gates, lifts, routes, and evidence that people and agents share.",
          "wordCount": 19,
          "alignedWordCount": 19,
          "speechStartSeconds": 9.742,
          "speechEndSeconds": 18.604,
          "meanConfidence": 0.8683,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.3504,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9983
        },
        {
          "id": "03-mission",
          "text": "The mission: reach Platform 2 from Entrance A without stairs, while exposing uncertainty. The agent reads the camera and finds the accessible gate.",
          "wordCount": 22,
          "alignedWordCount": 22,
          "speechStartSeconds": 19.324,
          "speechEndSeconds": 27.606,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9674,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.7794,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9995
        },
        {
          "id": "04-baseline-route",
          "text": "The first route uses the east corridor and Lift 1. It appears in the scene, where every turn stays inspectable.",
          "wordCount": 19,
          "alignedWordCount": 19,
          "speechStartSeconds": 28.126,
          "speechEndSeconds": 34.488,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9559,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.712,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9993
        },
        {
          "id": "05-lift-closure",
          "text": "Then Lift 1 closes. Its proxy turns red, its state changes, and the route fails visibly. The outage is reversible, never hidden.",
          "wordCount": 21,
          "alignedWordCount": 21,
          "speechStartSeconds": 35.228,
          "speechEndSeconds": 43.81,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9424,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.7542,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9987
        },
        {
          "id": "06-alternate-route",
          "text": "The agent reroutes through Lift 2. The trip remains possible, but the West corridor raises a warning: wayfinding readiness is only just over half.",
          "wordCount": 23,
          "alignedWordCount": 23,
          "speechStartSeconds": 44.51,
          "speechEndSeconds": 53.012,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9578,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.7304,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9994
        },
        {
          "id": "07-evidence",
          "text": "Why? The directional sign has one oblique, low resolution view. Connectivity is known, but its text remains unverified.",
          "wordCount": 18,
          "alignedWordCount": 18,
          "speechStartSeconds": 53.632,
          "speechEndSeconds": 61.094,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9266,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.3206,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9989
        },
        {
          "id": "08-recapture",
          "text": "SceneIndex turns doubt into fieldwork: recapture the sign front-on, then walk a reverse pass from Lift 2. Six markers make the plan concrete.",
          "wordCount": 23,
          "alignedWordCount": 23,
          "speechStartSeconds": 61.634,
          "speechEndSeconds": 70.576,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9333,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.4421,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.999
        },
        {
          "id": "09-human-control",
          "text": "The person keeps control: inspect, challenge, accept, or undo. One action restores Lift 1 and the clean baseline.",
          "wordCount": 17,
          "alignedWordCount": 17,
          "speechStartSeconds": 71.076,
          "speechEndSeconds": 77.978,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9724,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.8468,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.999
        },
        {
          "id": "10-webmcp",
          "text": "Web M C P connects to this live interface. Ten narrow tools share scene state, validation, effects, and a human-visible action timeline.",
          "wordCount": 23,
          "alignedWordCount": 23,
          "speechStartSeconds": 78.598,
          "speechEndSeconds": 86.42,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9396,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.5667,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9997
        },
        {
          "id": "11-impact",
          "text": "The station is synthetic, but this pattern supports accessibility review, handover, inspection, maintenance, and targeted recapture without pretending pixels know more.",
          "wordCount": 21,
          "alignedWordCount": 21,
          "speechStartSeconds": 86.88,
          "speechEndSeconds": 95.542,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9373,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.4996,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.9993
        },
        {
          "id": "12-close",
          "text": "SceneIndex makes a place searchable, testable, and honest about evidence. When the world changes, the route changes with it.",
          "wordCount": 19,
          "alignedWordCount": 19,
          "speechStartSeconds": 96.102,
          "speechEndSeconds": 102.204,
          "meanConfidence": 0.9299,
          "minimumWordConfidence": 0.6689,
          "maximumWordConfidence": 0.999
        }
      ],
